<section class="section" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq">
      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          Does student data leave the building?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">It is designed not to: local inference and private retrieval on the Curator Node.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          What if the AI gets something wrong?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Curator drafts; the teacher decides. Nothing sends without an approval click.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          What is a Curator Node?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">A pre-configured local server on off-the-shelf hardware; no custom silicon.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          Why open-core?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Inspection and trust drive adoption; we monetize the appliance, managed updates, support, enterprise.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          How is this different from cloud AI adding "local mode"?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Architecture, not a feature.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary class="faq-question">
          Is this FIPPA-compliant?
          <svg class="faq-chevron" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3 6l5 5 5-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-answer">Designed for local data sovereignty and institutional privacy requirements; formal privacy review is a funded milestone.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
